abstract: >
  HippoReplayIMM is a standalone Python package for benchmarking motion-model
  and interacting-multiple-model interpretations of hippocampal replay in the
  Pfeiffer/Foster open-field dataset.
keywords:
  - hippocampal replay
  - interacting multiple models
  - motion models
  - Bayesian filtering
  - neuroscience
